  "overrides": [
    { "field": "archetype", "reason": "Starmie's idle stands on two of its lower points (LLeg-LFoot, RLeg-RFoot), so the rules read a biped, but it is a sea star that lives in the sea (PokéAPI files it as a blob). As an aquatic body those points and its side points (LArm-LHand, RArm-RHand) are paddles that stroke, two sets in alternation; rig-overrides.json keeps it in the water." },
